,","s":86.294,"e":86.934},{"text":"where","s":87.014,"e":87.094},{"text":"each","s":87.174,"e":87.334},{"text":"new","s":87.414,"e":87.494},{"text":"engineer","s":87.574,"e":87.974},{"text":"arrives","s":88.054,"e":88.454},{"text":"with","s":88.534,"e":88.774},{"text":"no","s":88.894,"e":89.014},{"text":"memory","s":89.174,"e":89.334},{"text":"of","s":89.414,"e":89.494},{"text":"what","s":89.574,"e":89.654},{"text":"happened","s":89.734,"e":89.974},{"text":"on","s":90.054,"e":90.134},{"text":"the","s":90.214,"e":90.294},{"text":"previous","s":90.534,"e":90.774},{"text":"shift.","s":90.934,"e":91.654},{"text":"That's","s":91.774,"e":91.974},{"text":"what","s":92.054,"e":92.134},{"text":"a","s":92.174,"e":92.214},{"text":"loop","s":92.294,"e":92.454},{"text":"of","s":92.534,"e":92.614},{"text":"fresh","s":92.774,"e":92.934},{"text":"sessions","s":93.174,"e":93.414},{"text":"is.","s":93.494,"e":93.974}]},{"template":"loop","chapter":"The shift handoff","narration":"Their answer is a disciplined handoff. Every session gets its bearings first, from a progress file and the git log. It runs a quick smoke test. It implements exactly one failing feature, verifies it end to end, commits, and flips that feature's pass flag to true. Then the next shift begins.","params":{"title":"Every shift, the same routine","steps":[{"label":"Bearings","sub":"progress file + git log","icon":"search","at":"bearings"},{"label":"Smoke test","sub":"is it still working?","icon":"test","at":"smoke test"},{"label":"One feature","sub":"the next failing one","icon":"code","at":"exactly one"},{"label":"Verify + commit","sub":"flip passes → true","icon":"check","at":"commits"}],"center":{"label":"next shift","agent":true,"at":"next shift"}},"start":94.577,"dur":20.516,"words":[{"text":"Their","s":94.877,"e":95.117},{"text":"answer","s":95.197,"e":95.597},{"text":"is","s":95.677,"e":95.757},{"text":"a","s":95.837,"e":95.917},{"text":"disciplined","s":95.997,"e":96.477},{"text":"handoff.","s":96.557,"e":