 lesson from Ralph: if you can make a problem very verifiable, you can treat it like a black box and loop on it. Karpathy's AutoResearch is the same idea. Give an agent an objective, a metric and boundaries. Overnight, it found tunings in his code that he'd missed.","params":{"text":"Make it *verifiable*, and you can loop on it.","sub":"AutoResearch: “an objective, a metric, your boundaries. And go.” — Andrej Karpathy","sub_at":"objective","art":"gauge","tone":"good","sync":false},"start":115.093,"dur":25.557,"words":[{"text":"Loops","s":115.393,"e":115.793},{"text":"only","s":115.953,"e":116.193},{"text":"work","s":116.273,"e":116.513},{"text":"with","s":116.593,"e":116.673},{"text":"back","s":116.753,"e":116.913},{"text":"pressure:","s":116.993,"e":117.873},{"text":"checks","s":117.953,"e":118.193},{"text":"the","s":118.273,"e":118.313},{"text":"loop","s":118.353,"e":118.593},{"text":"has","s":118.673,"e":118.753},{"text":"to","s":118.793,"e":118.833},{"text":"satisfy,","s":118.993,"e":119.793},{"text":"like","s":119.913,"e":120.033},{"text":"tests,","s":120.113,"e":120.753},{"text":"types","s":120.953,"e":121.153},{"text":"and","s":121.233,"e":121.313},{"text":"linters.","s":121.393,"e":122.313},{"text":"Dex","s":122.753,"e":122.993},{"text":"Horthy's","s":123.033,"e":123.393},{"text":"lesson","s":123.473,"e":123.793},{"text":"from","s":123.873,"e":123.953},{"text":"Ralph:","s":124.033,"e":124.713},{"text":"if","s":124.993,"e":125.073},{"text":"you","s":125.113,"e":125.153},{"text":"can","s":125.233,"e":125.313},{"text":"make","s":125.393,"e":125.473},{"text":"a","s":125.513,"e":125.553},{"text":"problem","s":125.633,"e":126.033},{"text":"very","s":126.193,"e":126.433},{"text":"verifiable,","s":126.513,"e":127.553},{"text":"you","s":127.593,"e":127.633},{"text":"can","s":127.713,"e":127.793},{"text":"treat","s":127.873,"e":128.033},{"text":"it","s":128.073,"e":128.113},{"text":"like","s":128.193,"e":128.273},{"text":"a","s":128.353,"e":128.433},{"text":"black","s